{
  "format": 1,
  "notes": "Which parts of the engine exist, who owns which file, and what must pass when a file changes. `red_engine2 features` lists it, `red_engine2 impact --git` turns a working tree into the exact commands to run, `red_engine2 features --check` (and tests/features_index.rs) keep it true: every listed file/suite/doc must exist and every source file must belong to a feature. tests: `lib:<module::path>` = library unit tests under that module, anything else = tests/<name>.rs. depends_on = features whose change can break this one. serial_suites = suites that use real-time UDP or spawn servers: `affected` and CI run them one test at a time; every other suite runs on parallel threads.",
  "serial_suites": ["net_e2e", "net_flow", "net_abuse", "net_auth", "net_budget", "net_interest", "net_interactions", "net_processes", "net_rule_state", "net_sim", "sim_replay", "server_env", "ai_tasks", "net_bots"],
  "features": {
    "scene_format": {
